      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "edition": "Tuesday 27 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Eligibility hurdle",
          "heading": "Jeremy Ward named in France squad but will not play in November",
          "body": "Jeremy Ward has been named in France's 42-man squad but will not play in November. The South African centre completes his five-year residency only in 2027, so he will train with the group yet miss the Fiji, Springboks and Argentina Tests. Eligibility is the bigger hurdle: his four Junior Springboks appearances at the 2016 U20 Championship could tie him to South Africa, and Rapport suggests France may need the route England used for Benhard Janse van Rensburg. Ward told RMC Sport: \"Maybe there is an opportunity.\""
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Fiji beat Japan 34-28 in the centenary Test",
          "body": "Shaun Edwards signs as Argentina defence coach. Ardie Savea left out of New Zealand's Nations Championship squad. Ireland wings Tommy and Jimmy O'Brien forced off in URC interpro."
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "name": "SA Rugby Magazine"
      }
    },
    "388": {
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "edition": "Tuesday 27 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury worry",
          "heading": "Tommy and Jimmy O'Brien forced off in Leinster's win over Munster",
          "body": "Tommy and Jimmy O'Brien both left Saturday's URC interpro at the Aviva Stadium injured, a concern for Andy Farrell, who named both wings in Ireland's 36-man squad for the Nations Championship. Tommy was replaced in the second half with an apparent leg injury, while Jimmy took a head knock and was off before half-time. Leinster head coach Leo Cullen said he had not seen Jimmy in the dressing room and was unsure how Tommy was, with both being checked."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Fiji beat Japan 34-28 in the centenary Test",
          "body": "Shaun Edwards signs as Argentina defence coach. Ardie Savea left out of New Zealand's Nations Championship squad."
        }
      ],
      "source": {
